{"year":"2026","sessionID":"2026GS","sessionIndex":"1","billNumber":"HB0509","billNumberShort":"H.B. 509","billNumberLong":"HB0509S03","fileNumber":"2026FL1429","shortTitle":"Wetlands Study Amendments","currentSubVersion":"3","currentMinVersion":"0","primeSponsor":"OWENSDO","primeSponsorName":"Rep. Owens, Doug","primeSponsorHouse":"H","floorSponsor":"MCKELMK","floorSponsorName":"Sen. McKell, Michael K.","floorSponsorHouse":"S","generalProvisions":"This bill creates a study related to wetlands.","highlightedProvisions":"This bill:<hr><ltbullet>directs the Department of Natural Resources (department) to:<hr><ltbullet1>complete a study on wetlands in counties of the first or second class;<hr><ltbullet1>make recommendations for legislative and administrative action; and <hr><ltbullet1>report the study findings and recommendations to the Natural Resources, Agriculture, and Environment Interim Committee; <hr><ltbullet>restores a requirement that the department publish land use permits for wetlands collected by the Utah Geological Survey; and<hr><ltbullet>makes technical and conforming changes.","moniesAppropriated":"None","draftingAttorney":"Ryan C. Williams","fiscalAnalyst":"Ivan D. Djambov","lastAction":"Governor Signed","lastActionOwner":"Lieutenant Governor's office for filing","lastActionDate":"3/25/2026","trackingID":"PICBWIFBIL","actionHistoryList":[{"description":"Bill Numbered but not Distributed","owner":"Legislative Research and General Counsel","actionDate":"2026-02-06 10:11:46.337","actionClass":"L","voteID":"","voiceVote":"","voteHouse":"","voteStr":"","actionCode":"LNUMBER","parm1":"","parm2":""},{"description":"Numbered Bill Publicly Distributed","owner":"Legislative Research and General Counsel","actionDate":"2026-02-06 10:11:46.337","actionClass":"L","voteID":"","voiceVote":"","voteHouse":"","voteStr":"","actionCode":"LLFA","parm1":"","parm2":""},{"description":"LFA/ bill assigned to staff for fiscal analysis for HB0509","owner":"Legislative Fiscal Analy